{"suttaId":"tha-ap97","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5020,5041],"vripara":"24"},"segments":{"tha-ap97:0.3":"Gandhamāliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap97:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, gandhathūpaṃ akāsahaṃ;","tha-ap97:1.3":"Sumanehi paṭicchannaṃ, buddhānucchavikaṃ kataṃ.","tha-ap97:2.1":"“Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāsaṃ, buddhaṃ lokagganāyakaṃ;","tha-ap97:2.3":"Indīvaraṃva jalitaṃ, ādittaṃva hutāsanaṃ.","tha-ap97:3.1":"“Byagghūsabhaṃva pavaraṃ, abhijātaṃva kesariṃ;","tha-ap97:3.3":"Nisinnaṃ samaṇānaggaṃ, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhataṃ.","tha-ap97:4.1":"“Vanditvā satthuno pāde, pakkāmiṃ uttarāmukho;","tha-ap97:4.3":"Catunnavutito kappe, gandhamālaṃ yato adaṃ.","tha-ap97:5.1":"“Buddhe katassa kārassa, phalenāhaṃ visesato;","tha-ap97:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap97:6.1":"“Cattārīsamhi ekūne, kappe āsiṃsu soḷasa;","tha-ap97:6.3":"Devagandhasanāmā te, rājāno cakkavattino.","tha-ap97:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap97:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gandhamāliyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap97:9.1":"Gandhamāliyattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2774,"to":2774,"paras":[{"para":2774,"vripara":"24","refs":["tha-ap97:1"],"words":["siddhatthassa bhagavato"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>siddhatthassa bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap97:1"],["tha-ap97:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
